<title>UK: Dated Brent trades at firmer Nov Brent +3 cents.</title>
<headline>Dated Brent trades at firmer Nov Brent +3 cents.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dated Brent firmed on Tuesday as early October barrels sold for a premium to Nov Brent paper, traders said.</p>
<p>An Oct 4-6 cargo was sold to a French refiner for Nov Brent plus three cents a barrel by the U.K. major holding most of the October programme nominated so far.</p>
<p>Another Oct 4-6 cargo fetched parity to Nov Brent on Monday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
</text>
